WEBVTT

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.240
Hi.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.160
What was I doing?

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.680
Um

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.640
I was practicing on critters.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:33.440
I know I'm not supposed to.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.960
The queen said that I'm not cut out to

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:38.640
hunt humans yet.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.760
And I need to prove it to her that I can

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:43.680
do it.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.800
So I'm trying my best.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.680
You're a human, right?

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.120
Would you

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.040
Um

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:01.320
No, it's nothing.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:04.280
If you don't mind,

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:05.440
um

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.960
would you

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:10.640
let me practice on you?

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:13.800
Please. I'll be forever in your favor. I

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.720
need to prove to the queen that I can do

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.320
this.

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:22.160
I promise I won't

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:24.480
drain you.

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:26.640
I'll only

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:32.000
take enough to prove that I can do it.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.600
I promise.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.800
I'll be gentle.

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.680
Would you please

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:42.360
please let me practice on you?

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.640
Yeah.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.480
Thank you so much.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:48.480
Okay.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.320
I promise I will be

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:55.360
gentle and you won't You definitely

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:57.280
won't die, okay?

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:00.200
I'm just going to take enough so that

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.840
I can prove to myself and to the queen

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:06.680
that I would be able to hunt, okay?

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:08.240
So,

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:10.280
I would start with

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:14.560
piercing your skin.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:16.560
My My fang?

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:18.640
Oh.

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:19.200
Uh

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.560
I was born this way.

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:28.920
You don't think I can bite you?

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:34.520
I have more fangs than you do.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:38.280
Well,

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:40.000
just because I only have one fang

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.840
doesn't mean I can't pierce your skin.

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:45.840
Humans are squishy, okay?

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.840
Very squishy.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:50.160
And it'll be easy for me.

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:51.640
It doesn't matter

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:56.240
if I only have one.

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:58.240
I'll prove it to you.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:08.760
Okay, stay still.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:19.600
Stop squirming.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:29.440
Stay still, okay?

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:32.880
Your skin is really tough for a human.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:36.920
It's not because I only have one tooth.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:41.120
I'll show you.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:04:21.239
There we go.

00:04:21.239 --> 00:04:23.000
I did it.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:27.600
I can't believe I did it.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.200
I mean, I I knew I could do it. I knew

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:36.400
it.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:40.400
Would you mind if I kept going?

00:04:40.400 --> 00:05:25.560
Okay.

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:41.160
Are you afraid yet, human?

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:56.800
You taste way better than a critter.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:58.920
I can't believe I did it. I can't

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.680
believe I did it.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:16.280
The queen's going to be so proud of me.

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:32.560
Oh my god.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.280
Have you ever seen this much blood

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:40.600
before, human?

00:06:40.600 --> 00:07:11.000
Don't worry. I know when to stop, okay?

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:14.360
We should make this a thing, okay?

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:39.600
We should do this more often.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.200
It's not like

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:42.640
It's not like I can't catch other

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:45.280
humans.

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:49.200
I just like you.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:08:11.040
We should do this more often.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:14.200
Would you like to be my placing human?

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.680
We could do this all the time.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:20.280
That is if you want.

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:24.640
If you don't mind.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:29.200
I would very much like it.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.840
I think I should stop for now.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.680
You're looking a little

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:37.159
faint.

00:08:37.159 --> 00:08:41.000
Thank you so much for your time.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:44.039
I'm so proud of myself. Are you proud of

00:08:44.039 --> 00:08:46.000
me?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.720
I'm going to tell the queen

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:52.240
and she'll finally have trust in me.

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:54.000
And she'll finally

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:56.600
recognize that I am her favorite

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:59.440
vampire.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:01.760
Thank you, human.

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:05.320
Let's see each other again, okay?

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:10.320
Bye.
